# HTTP Client Test
मुद्रय "Testing HTTP GET..."
चर result = जाल_लाओ("https://httpbin.org/get")
मुद्रय "GET Result:", result[0:100]

मुद्रय "Testing HTTP POST..."
चर data = {"नाम": "परीक्षण", "मान": ४२}
चर postResult = जाल_भेजो("https://httpbin.org/post", data)
मुद्रय "POST Result:", postResult[0:100]

मुद्रय "HTTP tests complete!"
